\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {The threshold already sits on the accuracy--compute frontier.} For each seed we contrast the preregistered threshold with the cheapest policy the equal-budget optimizers found. The searched policies buy at most 2.1\% more saving than the threshold and, on seeds 0--1, do not pass the non-inferiority bound that the threshold passes. NI denotes the preregistered rule LCB$_{95\%}(\Delta \mathrm  {EM}) \geq -0.5$pp; extra saving is the compute the searched policy removes beyond the threshold, relative to the threshold's own saving. Full policy list in Table~\ref {tab:halting}.}}{6}{table.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:frontier}{{4}{6}{\textbf {The threshold already sits on the accuracy--compute frontier.} For each seed we contrast the preregistered threshold with the cheapest policy the equal-budget optimizers found. The searched policies buy at most 2.1\% more saving than the threshold and, on seeds 0--1, do not pass the non-inferiority bound that the threshold passes. NI denotes the preregistered rule LCB$_{95\%}(\Delta \mathrm {EM}) \geq -0.5$pp; extra saving is the compute the searched policy removes beyond the threshold, relative to the threshold's own saving. Full policy list in Table~\ref {tab:halting}}{table.caption.7}{}}
